    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Tencent Hy is a text only family of 6 versions, all publishing open weights, with 3 of the 6 supporting reasoning. Context windows range from 8192 to 1048576 tokens, so the line spans small translation style models and long context work. The Hy-MT2 entries, at 8192 tokens and 4096 max output, are the cheapest at $0.04 to $0.07 per million input and $0.18 to $0.29 output, but they do not support reasoning. Hy4 preview offers the largest context at 1048576 tokens and 64000 max output for $0.83 input and $2.5 output. Hy3 and Hy3 preview sit in between at 262144 tokens with reasoning, from $0.13 input. The family suits open weight deployment, long document handling and cost sensitive bulk text, while the largest context and output carry the highest price.",
